1
00:00:00,016 --> 00:00:03,716
(Amy:)Penny said she's not sure she wants
to be Leonard's girlfriend anymore.

2
00:00:06,957 --> 00:00:10,827
(Sheldon:)Wrong. She just took a sip
from his Diet Dr. Pepper.

3
00:00:11,461 --> 00:00:12,591
(Amy:)So?

4
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:15,253
(Sheldon:)So if she wants to end her pair-bond
with Leonard...

5
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:19,632
(Sheldon:)...why on earth would she guzzle
a witch's brew of his soda and spit?

6
00:00:21,371 --> 00:00:22,501
(Amy:)It's complicated.

7
00:00:22,672 --> 00:00:25,472
(Sheldon:)String Theory is complicated.

8
00:00:26,309 --> 00:00:27,499
(Sheldon:)That's just yucky.

9
00:00:30,514 --> 00:00:32,744
(Sheldon:)Don't get any ideas.

10
00:00:36,253 --> 00:00:39,053
(Sheldon:)All right, for the sake of argument,
let's say that's true.

11
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:41,316
(Sheldon:)Why doesn't Penny just end
the relationship?

12
00:00:41,491 --> 00:00:43,151
(Amy:)She's not sure how she feels.

13
00:00:43,794 --> 00:00:46,284
(Sheldon:)How can she not be sure
how she feels?

14
00:00:46,463 --> 00:00:49,223
(Sheldon:)You know, when I have a feeling,
I know it.

15
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:51,959
(Sheldon:)Trains? Love them.

16
00:00:52,569 --> 00:00:55,059
(Sheldon:)Swordfish? I love them too.

17
00:00:55,272 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)They're fish with a sword for a nose.

